---
const costs = [
  'Support tickets',
  'Onboarding calls',
  'Implementation delays',
  'Bad intake decisions',
  'Poor qualification',
  'Repeated internal explanations',
  'Low adoption',
  'Customer success workarounds',
  'Churn or retention drag',
  'Team exhaustion',
];
---

<section id="cost-transfer">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-label">Cost Transfer</div>
    <h2>A guidance failure rarely stays inside the screen.</h2>
    <p class="section-copy">
      If the product does not scaffold the next action, the cost moves somewhere else.
    </p>
    <div class="cost-card-grid">
      {costs.map((cost) => <div class="friction-card cost-card">{cost}</div>)}
    </div>
    <p class="section-copy cost-transfer-close">
      A Hidden Scaffold Review maps where the user stopped, what the product assumed, and which team is now paying for the missing guidance.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
